.TH XUZZEL.INI 5 "September 2026" "xuzzel 1.15.0-x11.2"
.SH NAME
xuzzel.ini \- xuzzel configuration
.SH DESCRIPTION
INI file with key=value pairs. Main settings may be unsectioned or under [main]. [colors], [border], and [dmenu] are accepted. Unknown keys produce warnings during normal loading and --check-config.
.SH MAIN KEYS
font, prompt, placeholder, message, terminal, launch-prefix, output, anchor, icon-theme, icon-size, fields, lines, width, tabs, horizontal-pad, vertical-pad, inner-pad, line-height, letter-spacing, x-margin, y-margin, icons-enabled, use-bold, minimal-lines, hide-prompt, hide-before-typing, match-counter, no-sort, sort-result, enable-mouse, auto-select, match-mode.
.PP
sort-result=yes enables deterministic match-class, score/position/chunk, history, and source-order sorting; sort-result=no preserves source order. no-sort=yes is the compatibility inverse. enable-mouse=no disables pointer handling and ButtonPress event subscription. match-mode=fuzzy splits input on spaces case-insensitively, ranks exact substrings above typo matches, and uses ordinary Unicode-code-point Levenshtein substring distance. fuzzy-min-length, fuzzy-max-length-discrepancy, and fuzzy-max-distance control typo matching and default to 3, 2, and 1.
.PP
icon-size sets launcher icon size in pixels; zero uses row height. Icons follow freedesktop theme inheritance through XDG data directories, hicolor, then pixmaps. Absolute PNG and SVG paths work.
.PP
Compatibility keys without a complete X11 implementation are accepted: namespace, dpi-aware, scaling-filter, layer, exit-on-keyboard-focus-loss, image-size-ratio, match-fields, match-workers, delayed-filter-ms, delayed-filter-limit, render-workers, selection-radius, list-executables-in-path, show-actions, filter-desktop, password-character, default-mode, include. Physically unsupported gamma-correct blending and unimplemented message-mode are not accepted.
.SH COLORS
Values are RRGGBB, #RRGGBB, or RRGGBBAA. Alpha is accepted but ignored. Keys: background, text, prompt, placeholder, input, match, selection, selection-text, selection-match, counter, border, message.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
[main]
font=monospace:size=12
prompt=> 
lines=12
width=40
match-mode=fzf
anchor=center

[colors]
background=1e1e2e
text=d9e0ee
selection=cba6f7
selection-text=1e1e2e
border=cba6f7

[border]
width=2
.fi
.SH FILES
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/fuzzel/fuzzel.ini, $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xuzzel/xuzzel.ini, ~/.config/fuzzel/fuzzel.ini, ~/.config/xuzzel/xuzzel.ini, and equivalent files under $XDG_CONFIG_DIRS. First readable file wins.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xuzzel (1)
